ids since it  has admittedly been several years since  all of this was brought to light the  names of the original kids were gabriel  fritz suzy jeremy and cassidy who  possessed the animatronics freddy foxy  chica bonnie and golden freddy  respectively also keep in mind this is  only according to the games and not  taking the novels into account which  only really served to kind of shuffle  the lore around a little bit and rarely  give us any straight answers as far as  the game's lore is concerned all of the  children's spirits except for gold and  freddies were released from their  animatronic prisons at the end of fnaf 3  when you see their masks in front of you  no longer glowing which they were in the  bad ending indicating that they have  found their piece at long last due to  the events leading up to the good ending  however if you contrast the good ending  with the bad ending once again you'll  notice that there is a freddy mask  behind the four that would be the fifth  animatronic golden freddy whose eyes are  lit up just like the rest of them but in  the good ending though the four  animatronic masks in front are cleansed  of spirits the fifth one behind them is  missing golden freddy cassidy is not yet  at rest this is speculated to be because  cassidy is the vengeful spirit extremely  angry at afton for his murders the one  who he should not have killed but we'll  get to that in a sec speaking of afton  after he burns at the end of fnaf 3 he  somehow survives as shown by this  cutscene from sister location which  ironically you have to complete a custom  night under the preset golden freddy to  unlock hint hint although golden freddy  himself does not actually appear in the  game it does however seem to connect the  two and foreshadow some lore fast  forward to the pizzeria simulator or  fnaf 6 which featured afton once again  showing up as scrap trap having survived  burning previously as springtrap at the  end of this game afton's ex-partner  henry emily burns down the location  presumably killing scrap trap and  michael afton and baby and molten freddy  and lefty and himself which would have  been a really nice ending to the series  all things considered but you know  popular money-making franchises never  really die anyway to bring this back to  cassidy and golden freddy it is widely  speculated that after these fiery events  transpire cassidy may have prevented  william afton from dying completely so  that she could torture him for all  eternity in the hell known as ultimate  custom night where we actually play as  the murderer afton himself this is  seemingly proven by many of the  animatronics speaking to the player  character as if they are resentful  against him often saying hateful things  and making references to quote the one  you should not have killed  [Laughter]  which if you use a bit of logical  deduction contrasting with the original  five mci victims and the golden one  that's still alive and more supernatural  and powerful than the rest and who was  linked to afton survival by way of  sister location's golden freddy custom  night preset  it's pretty obvious that cassidy golden  freddy is william afton's tormentor the  one he should not have killed and  ironically the reason why afton's spirit  does not actually disappear even after  dying to a springlock suit and burning  several times so that's the recap and  everything we know about golden cassidy  friday leading up to security breach in  a nutshell besides the supernatural  animatronics brief appearance in fnaf ar  special delivery but there's really not  much more to gather there other than  just simply an appearance from the  character cassidy's name showing up as  the protagonist character in the  princess quest games could actually work  since we don't have a confirmed ending  to golden freddy yet so obviously it was  clear to all of us that we would be  seeing the entity again right the  question is of course how is this golden  freddy 