  of the old animatronics to their system  one of which was the burned remains of  scrap trap but even though scrap trap  was burned and unusable it still had the  spirit of william afton bound to it due  to cassidy's desire to torment him and  not let him go and when the  broken-bodied scrap trap circuit board  was scanned in it gave the spirit of  afton attached to it a new body if you  will in the form of fazbear's virtual  environment giving him free roam within  the digital world leading to vanity's  corruption and the events of security  breach as a whole  and what makes us even worse and  connects it to cassidy is the fact that  most likely this would not have happened  if cassidy would have just released her  rage and allowed william afton to move  on like her friends did but her  unbridled unholy anger towards her  murderer prevented her from allowing  this and thus william afton's  resurrection as glitch trap and the  furthering of the five nights at  freddy's storyline is all cassidy's  fault and i'm not pulling this out of  thin air either this is more or less  confirmed by a tiny little character  known as old man consequences who first  appeared in fnaf world but ultimately  came back with lore implications in  ultimate custom night in the game if you  set every animatronic level to zero but  old man consequences to one you'll  eventually get a pop-up of the character  fishing on screen if you press the  button to catch the fish and do it  properly you'll be transported to a  different mini-game you play as what is  unmistakably a freddy fazbear icon which  given the game we're playing presumably  means you're playing as golden freddy  cassidy though it's not completely  confirmed due to everything being  monotone but  come on it's golden freddy if you walk  up to him and speak to him he'll tell  you this come and sit with me a while  leave the demon to his demons rest your  own soul there is nothing else knowing  that ultimate custom night is a hell f