eady been transferred into burn trap  and it also depends on which ending of  the game is actually canon but until  something else is revealed to us by way  of dlc and we're able to confirm or  deconfirm everything i talked about in  this video this will remain just my  theory but what did you guys think is  golden freddy cassidy the savior of vani  and defeater of glitch trap redeeming  her mistakes for keeping afton alive or  is this literally just another cassidy  with no lore implications whatsoever let  me know in the comments below also thank  you so much for watching the first fanaf  video on the channel regarding the  mysterious client 46 from the retro  series was really successful in terms of  my videos and i wouldn't have been brave  enough to try covering this franchise  again if it wasn't for the great turnout  so thank you all so much for watching it  and if you haven't checked it out yet  i'll link to it in the description below  please consider leaving a like if you  enjoyed my second deep dive into fnaf  lore and subscribe if you haven't  already to stick around for the next  deep dive humongous thanks of course to  my bandit crew who are ultimately the  reason i keep making these videos and  that's about all i had for this one as  always i hope you have a wonderful rest  of your day this is massington abandoned  looking forward to seeing you next time  and signing out peace  [Music]  you

